flowchart TD
    A[Planner] --> B[Executor]
    B --> C[Evaluator]
    C --> D{Accept output?}
    D -- Yes --> E[Complete step]
    D -- No --> F{Retry allowed?}
    F -- Yes --> B
    F -- No --> G[Escalate to supervisor]
    G --> H{Fallback or human review?}
    H -- Fallback --> I[Fallback path]
    H -- Human review --> J[Human escalation]
